This is a goinstall-able mirror of modified code already published at:
http://git.nic.cz/redmine/projects/golexer/repository

Online godoc documentation for this package available at:
https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/next-bin/go-sqlite/v2/lexer

Installation:
$ go get github.com/next-bin/go-sqlite/v2/lexer
